    "Every Axis infantry-type unit starts at two-thirds of its maximum TOE, fractions up (63.41).",
    "Tank TOE (63.42): I/5 Pz: PzII x2, PzIIIE x1, PzIIIH x4, PzIIIJ Special x4. II/5 Pz: PzII x2, PzIIIE x2, PzIIIH x4, PzIIIJ Special x4, PzIVE x1. I/8 Pz: PzII x1, PzIIIH x4, PzIIIJ Special x5, PzIVF2 Special x3. II/8 Pz: PzII x1, PzIIIG x1, PzIIIH x3, PzIIIJ Special x3, PzIVF2 x3, PzIVG x1 (letter unclear). LII(M) and VIII(M): M13/40 x6 each. I(L): L6 x6; II(L): L6 x4.",
    "Under repair at Tobruk: 3 PzIIIH and 1 PzIVD broken down (63.42).",
    "Upgrades (63.48): armoured cars and armoured recce upgrade free; two of Pistoia, Pavia, Bologna, Brescia swap their 75mm heavy AA for 2 TOE of 90mm; 605th SP has 6 TOE of Marder; 3.7cm AT in 15th and 21st Pz become 5cm, and their 5cm (and 90th Light's) become 7.62cm Pak(R); four Italian and two German brigade HQs become ad hoc AT batteries of 4 TOE (Italian AT guns / 2.8cm); Italian divisional 75/18 become 75/27; Littorio and Ariete SP battalions have 4 TOE of Semovente 75/18 each; the 164th's two III/220 battalions get 3 TOE 15cm K18 and 3 TOE 15cm sFH18; 149, 526 and 533 coastal battalions get 3 TOE of 15cm sIG33, 17cm K18 and 21cm Mrs18 respectively.",
    "The 10th Italian Light Flotilla and Raid on Rommel rules are not used (63.5)."
